  resultadoText: {fileID: 537261597}
  respuestaCorrecta1: While he was yet speaking
  respuestaCorrecta2: there came another and said
  respuestaCorrecta3: Your sons and daughters were eating and drinking wine in their
    oldest brother's house
  respuestaCorrecta4: and behold
  respuestaCorrecta5: a great wind came across the wilderness and struck the four
    corners of the house
  respuestaCorrecta6: and it fell upon the young people
  respuestaCorrecta7: and they are dead
  respuestaCorrecta8: and I alone have escaped to tell you
  respuestaCorrecta9: Then Job arose and tore his robe and shaved his head and fell
    on the ground and worshiped
  respuestaCorrecta10: And he said
  respuestaCorrecta11: Naked I came from my mother's womb
  respuestaCorrecta12: and naked shall I return
  respuestaCorrecta13: The LORD gave
  respuestaCorrecta14: and the LORD has taken away
  respuestaCorrecta15: blessed be the name of the LORD
  respuestaCorrecta16: In all this Job did not sin or charge God with wrong
  respuestaCorrecta17: 
  respuestaCorrecta18: 
  respuestaCorrecta19: 
